dsh-plugin-rtl-text README · Why the package declares `dsh.bundle`：The Harness plugin manager refuses packages without `dsh.bundle` with `declares no dsh.bundle`, because there would be no patch file to add to the profile's composition. This package declares:

```json
"dsh": {
  "bundle": {
    "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
  }

